// squad_skirmish — AOE damage burst. AbilityId 2.
// Lowers to AbilityProgram with EffectOp::Damage{amount=6} +
// per_effect_areas[0] = ShapeKind::Spread (radius=4.0, max_targets=8).
//
// `damage <amount> in spread(radius, max_targets)` exercises Wave 1.5#2
// in-shape lowering. The dispatcher (cg/emit/wgsl_body.rs) walks the
// spread radius from cast center and writes one EffectDamageApplied
// chronicle record per in-radius target (capped at max_targets via the
// 256-slot bitonic-sort scratch).
//
// Friendly-fire by default — the per-effect AOE walk does NOT consult
// `target: enemy` (that's a single-target gate). Verb's `when` gate
// handles the team filter on the cast site (caster), and the AOE walk
// hits every alive agent inside the radius. This is a known gotcha
// (project_aoe_gotchas.md).

ability Volley {
    target: enemy
    range: 12.0
    cooldown: 18
    hint: damage

    damage 6.0 in spread(4.0, 8) [PHYSICAL: 100]
}
